PAN",{"style":"font-size:18px;"},["SPAN",{"style":"font-family:crimson text,sans-serif;"}]]],"\n",["P",{},["SPAN",{"style":"font-size:18px;"},["SPAN",{"style":"font-family:crimson text,sans-serif;"},"Drape and immerse your senses in some of the world's most luxurious perfume brands which were carefully selected with your perfume needs in mind. If opulence and sophistication are what you're looking for, then you've made a stop at the right place."]]],"\n",["P",{}," "],"\n",["P",{},["SPAN",{"style":"font-size:18px;"},["SPAN",{"style":"font-family:crimson text,sans-serif;"},"There is a myriad of scents on offer across the perfume realm, with different notes, intensities and as well as quality. At ARC, we offer only the best from renowned brands because every spritz counts. Our brands use only premium ingredients that not only give off the best aroma, but also settle well on your skin to linger on a bit longer. Be spontaneous and dabble with fragrance layering, the art of mixing more than one scent for a unique and customised blend."]]],"\n",["P",{}," "],"\n",["P",{},["SPAN",{"style":"font-size:18px;"},["SPAN",{"style":"font-family:crimson text,sans-serif;"},"Your home and personal space say a lot about your taste when there’s a unique aroma to indulge in. Whether it’s with candles or scent diffusers, we’ve got what you need for that extra personal touch. Shop from our wide selection of men's and women's Eau de Parfums, Eau de Toilettes and more available online at ARC."]]],"\n    "],"\n                "],"\n            "]," \n        "],"\n    "],"\n        "],"\n    "],"\n    "],"\n    ",["FOOTER",{"class":"footer dw-mod"},"\n        ",["DIV",{"class":"center-container top-container__center-container dw-mod"},"\n            ",["DIV",{"class":"grid grid--external-bleed-x"},"\n                                    ",["DIV",{"class":"grid__col-lg-auto grid__col-md-auto grid__col-sm-12 grid__col-xs-12   dw-mod","id":"Block__MasterFooterColumnOne"},"\n                       